    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE LAND DEVELOPMENT ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 464)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      242.21,
      401.91,
      266.51
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      280.37,
      401.86,
      303.71
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Land Development(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      316.37,
      401.88,
      351.71
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 48A of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the repeal of the words \u201cor upon his or hermarriage\u201d in subsection 48A 2(c).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      376.37,
      401.88,
      399.71
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 48B of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the repeal of subsection 48B 1(a).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      436.37,
      401.88,
      483.71
    ],
    "text": "4. Section 68 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (1) of that section by the substitutionfor the words \u201cfails to succeed\u201d of the words \u201cfails withoutreasonable cause to succeed\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      496.37,
      401.9,
      519.71
    ],
    "text": "5.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
